flowchart LR
    %% =========================================================
    %% Real Estate AI Calling Agent - System Architecture
    %% =========================================================

    U[User / Agent] --> FE[React + Vite Frontend\n(Call UI + Lead Dashboard)]

    FE -->|Start Voice Call| VAPI[Vapi Voice AI Platform\nSTT + Conversation Orchestration + TTS]
    VAPI -->|Live Audio + AI Dialogue| U

    VAPI -->|Post-call Transcript + Metadata\nWebhook Event| BE[FastAPI Backend\n/webhook + REST API]

    BE -->|Lead Extraction Prompt| GROQ[Groq LLM\nStructured Lead Intelligence]
    GROQ -->|Extracted Entities\nName, Budget, Location, Intent, Timeline| BE

    BE -->|Generate Call Summary\nand Qualification Notes| BE
    BE -->|Persist Leads + Summaries| DB[(SQLite Database)]

    FE -->|GET /leads\nGET /leads/:id| BE
    BE -->|JSON Lead Records + Summaries| FE

    subgraph CLIENT[Client Layer]
        U
        FE
    end

    subgraph AI[Voice + Intelligence Layer]
        VAPI
        GROQ
    end

    subgraph APP[Application Layer]
        BE
        DB
    end
